{
  "bookId": "hero-212015",
  "id": "bond-33407",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33407001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "新人，你成功通过了考核。\n从今天起，你就是乾雷司的一员了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "刚才好像被电了一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "这是我们的传统，被我电一下，才是真正认可你哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那接下来呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "别着急，凡事欲速则不达。乾雷司最不缺的就是任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不过，像你这么积极的新人可不多。\n你究竟是为了什么才加入监天院？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33407008",
              "text": "我想守护平和的生活"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33407008",
              "text": "我想帮助身边的手办"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33407007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不错的信念，我很欣赏。\n那你知道，实现信念最重要的是什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33407010",
              "text": "是坚持？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33407010",
              "text": "是奋斗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33407009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "是休息！你考核的时候就哈欠连天，现在先好好睡一觉吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33407011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "别担心，雷鸣会伴你慢慢入睡的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
